{"title": "Soul Pillar Proximity", "pageid": 20656, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Pillar_Proximity", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Info.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Generic_Info.webp/300px-Generic_Info.webp, /w/images/e/ea/Generic_Info.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Generic_Info.webp/300px-Generic_Info.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Generic_Info.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Soul Pillar Proximity</b> is passive feature unique to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> feature that grants him bonuses for being close to his <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael/Combat#Soul_Pillar_Proximity\" title=\"Raphael/Combat\">Soul Pillars</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>For each remaining Soul Pillar, Raphael's attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d12</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage and he has a +3 bonus to his <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> score. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Each nearby soul pillar grants +1d12 <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">fire</a> damage and +3 <a href=\"/wiki/DEX\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DEX\">DEX</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203403\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1001/1000